# Development Environment Setup

## Required Tools
- Node.js 22+
- pnpm 10+
- Docker & Docker Compose
- Git

## Environment Files
- `.env` - Local environment variables
- `.env.local` - Local overrides
- `.env.example` - Template configuration

## Database Setup
- PostgreSQL via Docker Compose (port 5433)
- Redis via Docker Compose (port 6379)
- Prisma migrations required

## Development Commands
- `pnpm dev` - Start development server
- `pnpm test` - Run test suite
- `pnpm lint` - Run code quality checks
- `pnpm prisma studio` - Open database GUI

## Health Check
Run `./scripts/dev-health-check.sh` to verify environment.

## Quick Start
Run `./scripts/quick-start.sh` for complete environment setup.

## Database URLs
- PostgreSQL: localhost:5433
- Redis: localhost:6379
- Redis HTTP: localhost:8079

## Application URLs
- Web App: http://localhost:3001
- Prisma Studio: http://localhost:5555